omnigraph CLI: accept an inline s3:// cluster root for deployment, recovery
and maintenance.

Backport of https://github.com/ModernRelay/omnigraph/pull/1189 (commit
32722615815bfdf54add87a616ce4c828ad7f1c8 on blarghmatey:cli-s3-direct-roots)
onto the v0.14.0 tag (60bfd19db780fdff3a5178f959c1204143420114). The PR is
based on upstream main; its crates/ hunks apply to v0.14.0 as they are (two at
line offsets), so this is that diff regenerated against the tag. Its docs/,
skills/ and changelog.d/ hunks are left out: none of them touch the build, and
one targets a page v0.14.0 does not have.

docker/omnigraph-server.Dockerfile's cli-patched stage applies it with
`git apply`, which skips this header. Delete this file and that stage once a
release or an immutable edge build carries the change.

